<title>USA: Access Health in deal with Prepaid Health.</title>
<headline>Access Health in deal with Prepaid Health.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO CORDOVA, Calif. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Access Health Inc said it entered an agreement to provide care management services to about 120,000 members of Prepaid Health Plan, a not-for-profit full service managed care group owned by Health Services Medical Corporation of Central New York.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Prepaid Health members will have around-the-clock telephone access to symptom assessment, care options and health information provided by nurses.</p>
